stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING: ticket creado
    PENDING --> MANUAL_TRIAGE: falla un chequeo<br/>o falla segura
    PENDING --> EXECUTING: niveles 0 a 2
    PENDING --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: nivel 3 aprobado<br/>por VALIDATE (D-38)
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> PENDING: aprueba una persona
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: rechaza una persona<br/>con motivo
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> MANUAL_TRIAGE: vence el plazo<br/>(APROBACION_VENCIDA, D-34)
    EXECUTING --> SUCCESS: confirmado
    EXECUTING --> FAILED: error (no se reintenta)
    SUCCESS --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    MANUAL_TRIAGE --> [*]
